<title>LATVIA: CENTRAL BANK SETS REPO RATES.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK SETS REPO RATES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set repurchase rates for maturities from one month to 12 months.</p>
<p>The one month rate for the July 11 repo auction was three percent, three months was four percent, the six month rate was five percent and the 12-month was six percent.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
